    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FlyJAL\nJHIFUO\nTOKYO, JAPAN\nOÇ8\nJAPAN\nAIR\nLINES\nOp.\n671\nOP. AKIRA FURUKAWA\nQTH.\n3-3-118, Higashi, Shisui, Shisui-cho,\nInba-gun, Chiba-ken, -\nJAPAN",
      "MOUNT FUJI IS BEAUTIFUL FROM ANY PERSPECTIVE.\nUntil the age of airplanes, only the eagle had a view\nlike this. The Japanese love the trees, the rocks,\nand above\nall this inspiring mountain. With its\nskirt hidden by soft clouds, its snow capped summit\nseems to float in the sky-\nRadio\nDate\nTime\nUr Sigs\nBand\nRemarks\nGMT /JST\nPOST CARD\nYour\nwill be\nQSL\nis\nappreciated\nJAPAN AIR LINES\nJAL\nPRINTED IN JAPAN\n2015.166.0832"
    ],
